    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A charming three-bedroom bungalow residence set on aproximately 0.71 acres in a peaceful rural setting, close to Wexford Town and the beautiful South Wexford coastline.  Coalspit is a superbly located bungalow residence, occupying a mature and generous site of approximately 0.71 acres. Combining comfortable, well-proportioned accommodation with a tranquil countryside setting, the property offers an excellent opportunity to enjoy rural living while remaining within convenient reach of Wexford Town and an excellent range of local amenities.  Internally, the accommodation comprises of a spacious sitting room with adjoining dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, utility room, three generous double bedrooms and two bathrooms. The property is further complemented by a garage with concrete floor and convenient side access.  The location is particularly appealing, with Wexford Town approximately 13km away and a wonderful selection of beaches and coastal attractions within easy reach. Ballyhealy, Kilmore, Rosslare, St. Helens and Carne beaches are all readily accessible, while the picturesque fishing village of Kilmore Quay is close by. Renowned for its scenic harbour and excellent restaurants, Kilmore Quay also offers daily sailings to the beautiful Saltee Islands. Everyday amenities, including schools, shops and churches, are available in the neighbouring villages of Bridgetown, Kilmore, Baldwinstown and Killinick. Rosslare Europort, is approximately 16km away, provides ferry services together with rail and bus connections, while the N25, N11/M11 and R736 provide convenient access to the wider road network. Mayglass is a highly regarded rural location, offering the best of both worlds: a peaceful countryside environment surrounded by mature greenery, yet within easy reach of Wexford Town, the coast and the many attractions of South Wexford. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the setting, accommodation and potential of this attractive country residence."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - (3.9m x 1.7m), Laminate flooring.\r\nSitting Room - (3.7m x 5.1m), Laminate flooring, stove with feature surround, built in shelving, double doors to dining room.\r\nKitchen - (3m x 3.4m),  Eye & Waist level units, tiled flooring, tiled splashback, electric hob, overhead extractor.\r\nUtility Room - (2.5m x 1.3m), Tiled flooring, plumbed for washing machine, door to rear garden.\r\nDining Room - (4.1m x 2.9m), Laminate flooring, double doors to sitting room.\r\nInner Hallway - (6.1m x 0.9m), Carpet flooring and hotpress.\r\nBedroom 1 - (3.7m x 3m), WHB, Carpet flooring.\r\nBedroom 2 - (3.7m x 3m), WHB, Carpet flooring.\r\nMaster Bedroom - (3m x 4.2m), Laminate flooring, shower, WHB.\r\nBathroom - (0.9m x 3m), WC, WHB, tiled flooring and tiled walls\r\nBathroom 2 - (1.6m x 3m), WC, WHB, tiled wall and floor, shower.\r\nGarage - (3m x 4.8m), Concrete flooring, sliding door and side door access.\r\n\r\nOutside: Gardens to front and rear, spacious parking, Garage.\r\nServices: Electricity, mains water, private sewerage, oil fired central heating.\r\nBER: D Ber No: 119773703 Performance indicator: 228.14 Wh/m2/yr"
      },
